      "message": "docs: complete data-templates.adoc with comprehensive examples\n\nAdd comprehensive documentation for creating UDB data files including:\n\n- Extension definitions with basic and advanced templates\n- Instruction definitions with encoding, assembly, and operation examples\n- CSR definitions with field types, RV32/RV64 handling, and IDL\n- Parameter definitions with schema types\n- Validation steps and best practices\n- Links to real examples in the repository\n\nThis replaces the previous TODO placeholder with ~380 lines of\nbeginner-friendly documentation to help new contributors understand\nthe UDB data structure.\n\nCloses #1343\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
